      ":question/problem": "![](images/fb/fb705d0caa191a4194084a8c8acc8c6bb414666b5aec371f9b2947a4888e470d.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, the parallel lines $l$, $m$, and $n$ are crossed by the transversal $t$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u2220JHK\u2245\u2220AEG$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $\u2220JHK\u2245\u2220FEH$ | {{field-1}} |\n| 2 | $\u2220AEG\u2245\u2220FEH$ | {{field-2}} |\n| 3 | $\u2220FEH\u2245\u2220AEG$ | {{field-3}} |\n| 4 | $\u2220JHK\u2245\u2220AEG$ | {{field-4}} |"
